{"id":"0e5993b5dc10694f","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-tree11-wellfounded-part.md","title":"ZFC Tree11 Wellfounded Part","display":"df-zfc-tree11-wellfounded-part — ZFC Tree11 Wellfounded Part","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree11-wellfounded-part","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree11-wellfounded-part"],"display":"df-zfc-tree11-wellfounded-part — ZFC Tree11 Wellfounded Part","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree11-wellfounded-part"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree11-wellfounded-part</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree11-wellfounded-part — ZFC Tree11 Wellfounded Part"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,T\\in V\">\\(W,T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (tree-of-sequences predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11WellfoundedPart}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11WellfoundedPart}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}wellfounded\\text{-}part} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11WellfoundedPart}_S(W,T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in T\\times T:a\\subseteq b\\})\\land W=\\{t\\in T:\\neg\\exists b\\in T^\\omega\\;(b(0)=t\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(b(n)\\subsetneq b(n+1)))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}wellfounded\\text{-}part} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11WellfoundedPart}_S(W,T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in T\\times T:a\\subseteq b\\})\\land W=\\{t\\in T:\\neg\\exists b\\in T^\\omega\\;(b(0)=t\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(b(n)\\subsetneq b(n+1)))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary wellfounded part definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (tree-of-sequences predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11WellfoundedPart}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}wellfounded\\text{-}part} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11WellfoundedPart}_S(W,T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in T\\times T:a\\subseteq b\\})\\land W=\\{t\\in T:\\neg\\exists b\\in T^\\omega\\;(b(0)=t\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(b(n)\\subsetneq b(n+1)))\\}","display":true}],"bytes":979,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3806","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-tree11-wellfounded-part.md|58-df-zfc-tree11-wellfounded-part]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["d25b709595952a78"]}